```sql
SELECT COUNT(*) AS shipments_count
FROM shipments
WHERE destination_country = 'Germany'
  /* Shipments that were sent in the previous month */
  AND shipped_at >= date_trunc('month', current_date) - INTERVAL '1 month'
  AND shipped_at <  date_trunc('month', current_date)
  /* Make sure we have a delivery date */
  AND delivered_at IS NOT NULL
  /* Took more than five days to deliver */
  AND (delivered_at - shipped_at) > INTERVAL '5 days';
```

This returns the number of German shipments that were shipped last month and whose delivery time exceeded five days.
